{%- comment -%}
  Category tiles — site-structure.md §8.3: four tiles, each with a "לרכישה" CTA.
  Built 2026-08-20 as part of the boho-boutique homepage pass (the owner: "go full,
  don't stop to ask"). Structure follows the UrbanStems reference in examples/ —
  a horizontal row of rounded photo cards with a label below, scroll-snap on
  mobile instead of a cramped 4-up grid, a real grid once there is room.

  Images are the owner's own photography (supplied 2026-08-23, replacing the
  original Unsplash placeholders), processed to 900×1125 at
  theme/assets/home-cat-*.{jpg,webp}. Full-resolution sources are kept in
  docs/brand/home-cat-sources/.

  "דקור" is used as the Hebrew display name for the decor category. That gap
  was open in status.md ("decor needs a Hebrew display name") — דקור is the
  everyday Hebrew loanword for it, used here as a placeholder still open for
  the owner to override, not a new decision closed on his behalf.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'florista-categories.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign items = 'bouquets|זרי פרחים|home-cat-bouquets|/collections/bouquets,box-arrangements|סידורים בקופסה|home-cat-box|/collections/box-arrangements,basket-arrangements|סידורים בסלסלה|home-cat-basket|/collections/basket-arrangements,decor|דקור|home-cat-decor|/collections/decor' | split: ','
-%}

<section class="cg-section">
  <div class="cg-inner">
    <h2 class="cg-heading">קטגוריות</h2>

    <ul class="cg-row">
      {%- for item in items -%}
        {%- assign parts = item | split: '|' -%}
        {%- assign label = parts[1] -%}
        {%- assign image = parts[2] -%}
        {%- assign url = parts[3] -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          `decor` does not exist as a collection, so this tile was a live 404 from the first
          content band on the homepage. Rather than decide what belongs there — that is the owner's
          call, and the GSC data shows no demand for `דקור` either way — a tile whose collection
          is missing is simply not rendered. Create the collection and the tile returns by
          itself; no code change needed. Guarded 2026-08-30.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if collections[parts[0]].id == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        <li class="cg-tile">
          <a class="cg-link" href="{{ url }}">
            <picture>
              <source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ image | append: '.webp' | asset_url }}">
              <img
                class="cg-img"
                src="{{ image | append: '.jpg' | asset_url }}"
                alt=""
                width="900"
                height="1125"
                loading="lazy"
              >
            </picture>
            <span class="cg-label">{{ label }}</span>
            <span class="cg-cta">לרכישה</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Florista categories",
  "presets": [{ "name": "Florista categories" }]
}
{% endschema %}
